<title>USA: Wm. Wrigley board member resigns.</title>
<headline>Wm. Wrigley board member resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wm. Wrigley Jr Co said Thursday that board member Gary Gardner has resigned.</p>
<p>It said Gardner has begun a new venture in the health and beauty aid market sector and lacked time to fulfill the obligation required as a Wrigley director.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
